{% doc %}
  Block: Custom Text

  Description:
    A rich text block with separate content, width, max-width, and typography
    controls for desktop and mobile. Extends the Horizon text block with
    more granular responsive control. If mobile content is left empty,
    desktop content is used as fallback.

  Settings:
    Content:
    - text (richtext): Desktop text content.
    - text_mobile (richtext): Mobile text content. Falls back to desktop if empty.

    Desktop layout (750px and above):
    - width (select): fit-content or 100%. Default: "fit-content"
    - max_width (select): narrow, normal, none, or custom. Default: "normal"
    - custom_max_width (number): Custom max-width in px. Default: 600. Visible when max_width is custom.
    - alignment (text_alignment): Text alignment when width is 100%. Default: "left"

    Mobile layout (below 750px):
    - width_mobile (select): fit-content or 100%. Default: "fit-content"
    - max_width_mobile (select): narrow, normal, none, or custom. Default: "normal"
    - custom_max_width_mobile (number): Custom max-width in px. Default: 400. Visible when max_width_mobile is custom.
    - alignment_mobile (text_alignment): Text alignment when width is 100%. Default: "left"

    Desktop typography:
    - type_preset (select): rte, paragraph, h1–h6, or custom. Default: "rte"
    - font (select): Font family. Visible when custom.
    - weight (select): Font weight (100–900). Visible when custom.
    - font_size (select): Font size. Visible when custom.
    - line_height (select): tight, normal, loose. Visible when custom.
    - letter_spacing (select): tight, normal, loose. Visible when custom.
    - case (select): none, uppercase, lowercase, capitalize. Visible when custom.
    - wrap (select): pretty, balance, nowrap. Visible when custom.
    - margin_top (number): Top margin in px. Visible when custom.
    - margin_bottom (number): Bottom margin in px. Visible when custom.
    - color (color): Text color. Visible when preset is not rte.

    Mobile typography:
    - type_preset_mobile (select): inherit, rte, paragraph, h1–h6, or custom. Default: "inherit"
    - font_mobile (select): Font family. Visible when custom.
    - weight_mobile (select): Font weight (100–900). Visible when custom.
    - font_size_mobile (select): Font size. Visible when custom.
    - line_height_mobile (select): tight, normal, loose. Visible when custom.
    - letter_spacing_mobile (select): tight, normal, loose. Visible when custom.
    - case_mobile (select): none, uppercase, lowercase, capitalize. Visible when custom.
    - wrap_mobile (select): pretty, balance, nowrap. Visible when custom.
    - margin_top_mobile (number): Top margin in px. Visible when custom.
    - margin_bottom_mobile (number): Bottom margin in px. Visible when custom.
    - color_mobile (color): Text color. Visible when preset is not rte or inherit.

    Appearance:
    - background (checkbox): Enable background. Default: false.
    - background_color (color): Background color with alpha. Visible when background enabled.
    - corner_radius (range): 0–50px. Visible when background enabled.

  Notes:
    - Desktop styles apply at 750px and above.
    - Desktop and mobile typography presets are independent — selecting "custom"
      on desktop does not affect mobile preset margins, and vice versa.
    - When custom typography is selected, preset margins (h1–h6, p) are removed
      so margin_top/margin_bottom settings have full control.
    - Font weight defaults to the selected font family's weight when set to "Default".
{% enddoc %}

